[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/workspace/repo/changelog_unreleased/angular/19035.md", "content": "#### Support arrow functions and `instanceof` in Angular templates (#19035 by @user)

Arrow function expressions and the `instanceof` operator in Angular templates
(inside `@let` declarations, interpolations, and event bindings) are now
formatted consistently with the rest of the template. Arrow function parameter
lists never get a trailing comma, regardless of the `trailingComma` option.

<!-- prettier-ignore -->
```html
<!-- Input -->
{{ (  a  ) => a + 1 }}
{{ x    instanceof    Foo }}

<!-- Prettier stable -->
{{ (a) => a + 1 }}
{{ x instanceof Foo }}

<!-- Prettier main -->
{{ (a) => a + 1 }}
{{ x instanceof Foo }}
```
